Barreeffama irratti: ['html'] godhi: { <- (
		ofii
		bakka-buusi: ['&'] tiin: ['&amp;'],
		bakka-buusi: ['<'] tiin: ['&lt;'],
		bakka-buusi: ['>'] tiin: ['&gt;'],
		bakka-buusi: ['"'] tiin: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Tarree-wantootaa haaraa.

['Verbatim Syntax'] qubeewwan hundaaf: { :gara-lakkoofsaatti :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (gara-lakkoofsaatti), Letter: letter).
}.

Baʼii list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list waliingalchi: ['↵']).

Baʼii barreessi: template.

